{"question_id": "L06", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"每枚飞弹对其目标造成 1d4 + 1 点力场伤害。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:spell:magic-missile\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens": 1100, "total_tokens": 1156, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1100}, "yuan": 0.002648, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "L07", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"当你在 1 级选择生命领域时，你获得重甲熟练。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:subclass:life-domain\"},{\"text\":\"同样从 1 级开始，你的治疗法术效果更佳：每当你使用一个 1 环或更高环位的法术恢复某个生物的生命值时，该生物还会额外恢复 2 + 法术环阶 点生命值。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:subclass:life-domain\"},{\"text\":\"此外，1 级选择神圣领域会赋予你领域法术和其他特性。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:cleric\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 150, "prompt_tokens": 5024, "total_tokens": 5174, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 5024}, "yuan": 0.011248, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "L08", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"目盲生物无法看见，并且任何需要视觉的属性检定都会自动失败。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:condition:blinded\"},{\"text\":\"针对该生物的攻击检定具有优势，而该生物的攻击检定具有劣势。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:condition:blinded\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 80, "prompt_tokens": 1528, "total_tokens": 1608, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1528}, "yuan": 0.003696, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "L10", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"成年红龙的挑战等级是17（18,000 XP）。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:monster:adult-red-dragon\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 4512, "total_tokens": 4561, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4512}, "yuan": 0.009416, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M01", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"当一个你能看见的敌对生物移动离开你的触及范围时，你可以对它进行一次借机攻击。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"进行借机攻击时，你使用自己的反应，对引发该攻击的生物进行一次近战攻击。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"此次攻击发生在该生物刚要离开你触及范围之前。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"你可以通过采取脱离接触动作来避免引发借机攻击。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"当你进行传送，或在别的东西推动你、移动你，而你自己没有使用移动、动作或反应时，也不会引发借机攻击。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 192, "prompt_tokens": 2531, "total_tokens": 2723, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 2531}, "yuan": 0.006598, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M03", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"拥有半掩护的目标，其 AC 与敏捷豁免获得 +2 加值。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"拥有四分之三掩护的目标，其 AC 与敏捷豁免获得 +5 加值。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 86, "prompt_tokens": 2565, "total_tokens": 2651, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 2565}, "yuan": 0.005818, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M05", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"短休是一段至少 1 小时的空闲时间，在此期间，角色只会进行吃喝、阅读、包扎伤口等不太费力的活动。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:adventuring\"},{\"text\":\"在短休结束时，角色可以花费一枚或多枚生命骰，最多可花费等于自己等级数量的生命骰；每花费一枚生命骰，玩家便掷出该骰，并加入角色的体质调整值，角色恢复等于总数的生命值（最低为 0）。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:adventuring\"},{\"text\":\"由创伤剑伤害所损失的生命值只能通过短休或长休恢复，而不能通过再生、魔法或任何其他方式恢复。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:equipment:sword-of-wounding\"},{\"text\":\"吟游诗人的灵感源泉特性使角色在完成一次短休或长休时，恢复所有已消耗的吟游激励使用次数。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:bard\"},{\"text\":\"大地结社德鲁伊的自然恢复特性允许在一次短休期间恢复若干已消耗的法术位，总等级不得超过德鲁伊等级的一半（向上取整），且不能有 6 环或更高环位。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:subclass:circle-of-the-land\"},{\"text\":\"法师的奥术恢复特性允许每天一次在完成短休时恢复若干已消耗法术位，总等级不得超过法师等级的一半（向上取整），且不能有 6 环或更高环位。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:wizard\"},{\"text\":\"法师的招牌法术使用后，必须完成一次短休或长休，才能再次以 3 环形式不消耗法术位施放。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:wizard\"},{\"text\":\"具体恢复哪些资源以及是否满足条件，最终由 DM 裁定。\",\"entry_id\":null}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 426, "prompt_tokens": 7639, "total_tokens": 8065, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 7639}, "yuan": 0.018686, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M06", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"每当你在自己回合开始时生命值为 0，都必须进行一次特殊豁免，称为死亡豁免，以决定你是进一步接近死亡，还是勉强抓住生机。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"掷一个 d20。若结果为 10 或更高，则成功；否则失败。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"当你累积第三次成功时，你会变为稳定状态。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"稳定 的生物不会进行死亡豁免，尽管它仍保持 0 生命值并继续失去意识。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"},{\"text\":\"一个未被治疗但已稳定的生物，会在 1d4 小时后恢复 1 点生命值。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:rule:combat\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 202, "prompt_tokens": 3672, "total_tokens": 3874, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 3672}, "yuan": 0.00896, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M08", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "retry": false, "raw": "{\"type\":\"answer\",\"refusal_category\":null,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"每回合一次，当你以一次攻击命中一个生物，且你的该次攻击检定具有优势时，可以对该生物额外造成 1d6 点伤害。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:rogue\"},{\"text\":\"该攻击必须使用灵巧武器或远程武器。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:rogue\"},{\"text\":\"如果目标 5 尺内有另一个它的敌人，且该敌人未失能，并且你此次攻击检定没有劣势，那么即使你没有优势，也可以造成偷袭伤害。\",\"entry_id\":\"srd51:class:rogue\"}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 146, "prompt_tokens": 2561, "total_tokens": 2707, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 2561}, "yuan": 0.00629, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
